  "documentationLink": "https://github.com/almulder/Hubitat-Drivers/tree/main/Samsung%20Appliance%20Service",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING CHANGES - check your rules before upgrading: (1) Energy is now kWh, 1000x smaller: Dishwasher/Dryer/Microwave energy; Washer energy, energySaved; Refrigerator energy, energySaved, energyThisMonth, energyLastMonth, powerEnergy. (2) Temperatures are converted to the hub scale and setpoint commands take hub-scale values; a setpoint is refused until the appliance reports its unit. (3) Air Conditioner temperature is now the room reading; outdoor moved to outdoorTemperature; AC gains Switch. (4) Induction Cooktop temperature is now the probe reading; the target moved to probeTargetTemperature. (5) Air Monitor/Vacuum Station battery is numeric. (6) Dishwasher filterUsage is a number. (7) Cooktop mainTimerState is a string. (8) Subdevice select attributes renamed Subdevice1X to subdevice1X, and subdevice readings no longer overwrite main attributes. (9) Refrigerator setFlexZoneMode/setPantryZoneMode are free text. (10) Debug logging is off by default and turns itself off after 30 minutes. Also: Listener 0.5.0 subscribes only to your appliances, keeps registry data across reconnects, recovers from stalled setup with backoff, never shrinks the subscription from a partial seed, and stops retrying a rejected token. Library 0.7.0 no longer delays trailing values, writes less state, and refuses unsafe setpoints. App 0.3.4 no longer stores the token in plain text. Drivers 0.7.0: Washer/Dryer cycle, option and delay-start commands; Oven/Range start refuses a bad mode, time or setpoint; setSelectOption on every driver with selects; Air Purifier/Range Hood setFan fixed; Battery, Humidity and CO2 capabilities.",
  "tags": [
    "Misc. Devices"
  ],
